          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;AmneziaWG 3.1. Appends a random trailer to every packet, so message types are no longer identifiable by size.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
